   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I just upgraded to using Nvim-R (0.9.3) and got it setup. I&#39;ve noticed that syntax highlighting doesn&#39;t appear to be working inside of rmarkdown chunks. For instance, below is a screenshot of a chunk</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-ZSFxOqe_bBc/VzkvQDsTANI/AAAAAAAAvU4/gNHxtpgiTKoLOQY-GZevs32HiymQM02JACLcB/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2016-05-15%2Bat%2B7.23.42%2BPM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-ZSFxOqe_bBc/VzkvQDsTANI/AAAAAAAAvU4/gNHxtpgiTKoLOQY-GZevs32HiymQM02JACLcB/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2016-05-15%252Bat%252B7.23.42%252BPM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494115876000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0WRWRcyx_B1BbF49eI6GHf\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-ZSFxOqe_bBc/VzkvQDsTANI/AAAAAAAAvU4/gNHxtpgiTKoLOQY-GZevs32HiymQM02JACLcB/s320/Screen%2BShot%2B2016-05-15%2Bat%2B7.23.42%2BPM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"158\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Here the read_tsv is a function from the readr R package and should be highlighted once it is loaded. But when this is in a normal R script, the syntax highlighting is fine:<br><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-KerfQpUYdR4/VzkvyX_rrfI/AAAAAAAAvVA/kHparQk2tVsgeLH80LVB0WsL79Qp-EjoACLcB/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2016-05-15%2Bat%2B7.25.34%2BPM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-KerfQpUYdR4/VzkvyX_rrfI/AAAAAAAAvVA/kHparQk2tVsgeLH80LVB0WsL79Qp-EjoACLcB/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2016-05-15%252Bat%252B7.25.34%252BPM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494115876000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1rDCQ5Qb-NqksVmHE7T9OX\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-KerfQpUYdR4/VzkvyX_rrfI/AAAAAAAAvVA/kHparQk2tVsgeLH80LVB0WsL79Qp-EjoACLcB/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2016-05-15%2Bat%2B7.25.34%2BPM.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>I am using vim v7.4.1830 installed from homebrew. Is there an additional setup step required for rmarkdown syntax highlighting?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "yVhT_cFIKwAJ",
   "from": "Jakson Alves de Aquino",
   "author": "b256a2742aacd200",
   "date": "2016-05-16T08:57:39Z",
   "subject": "Re: Nvim-R: Syntax Highlighting Not Working in Rmarkdown Chunks",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">On my system (Ubuntu 16.04 and development version of Nvim-R) it works. I tested the following code with both Vim and Neovim:<div><br><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">foreign</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">spss</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "qiqSH_diKwAJ",
   "from": "Fong Chun Chan",
   "author": "61221ab1f726dce8",
   "date": "2016-05-16T16:57:54Z",
   "subject": "Re: Nvim-R: Syntax Highlighting Not Working in Rmarkdown Chunks",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I tested this on Centos 7 distribution and the development version of Nvim-R:<div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-zXw3zJ6r920/Vzn7xFo3J9I/AAAAAAAAvVc/szCdKfyxNPQm1Y4fv6PhO7Ep3JH1zvxigCLcB/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2016-05-16%2Bat%2B9.54.54%2BAM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-zXw3zJ6r920/Vzn7xFo3J9I/AAAAAAAAvVc/szCdKfyxNPQm1Y4fv6PhO7Ep3JH1zvxigCLcB/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2016-05-16%252Bat%252B9.54.54%252BAM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494115877000&amp;usg=AOvVaw248eR4wiyKzbbouTbifq00\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-zXw3zJ6r920/Vzn7xFo3J9I/AAAAAAAAvVc/szCdKfyxNPQm1Y4fv6PhO7Ep3JH1zvxigCLcB/s320/Screen%2BShot%2B2016-05-16%2Bat%2B9.54.54%2BAM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"238\" height=\"320\"></a></p><div><br></div><div>read.spss isn&#39;t being highlighted in the rmarkdown chunk. But if using a normal .R script:</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Ou0wxIOEFo4/Vzn7_RqL5eI/AAAAAAAAvVg/f1Jv5nZ4W5YxYrZMmNBPl_SP4xhjpr9wACLcB/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2016-05-16%2Bat%2B9.56.28%2BAM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Ou0wxIOEFo4/Vzn7_RqL5eI/AAAAAAAAvVg/f1Jv5nZ4W5YxYrZMmNBPl_SP4xhjpr9wACLcB/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2016-05-16%252Bat%252B9.56.28%252BAM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494115877000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3HukGKoKjeI_78mPUowk9L\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Ou0wxIOEFo4/Vzn7_RqL5eI/AAAAAAAAvVg/f1Jv5nZ4W5YxYrZMmNBPl_SP4xhjpr9wACLcB/s320/Screen%2BShot%2B2016-05-16%2Bat%2B9.56.28%2BAM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"237\" height=\"320\"></a></p><div><br></div><div>No problem. Something appears to be off with .Rmd files?</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "40RegwdkKwAJ",
   "from": "Fong Chun Chan",
   "author": "61221ab1f726dce8",
   "date": "2016-05-16T17:17:24Z",
   "subject": "Re: Nvim-R: Syntax Highlighting Not Working in Rmarkdown Chunks",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I think the issue has to do with vim. I recall having a similar issue that I posted a while back:<br><br><div><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/vim-r-plugin/Pl2fJNHfdbk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!topic/vim-r-plugin/Pl2fJNHfdbk&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494115878000&amp;usg=AOvVaw17WBYchF4hPV4DWonZppwb\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/vim-r-plugin/Pl2fJNHfdbk</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>I ended up downgrading vim to v7.4.1100 and the syntax issues went away. But now that the Nvim-R requires &gt;= v7.4.1722, the syntax issues have re-appeared...</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "h2XINu9kKwAJ",
   "from": "Jakson Alves de Aquino",
   "author": "b256a2742aacd200",
   "date": "2016-05-16T17:33:59Z",
   "subject": "Re: Nvim-R: Syntax Highlighting Not Working in Rmarkdown Chunks",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;m using Vim 7.4.1831, and it works here.<div><br></div><div>It might be a markdown plugin or a specific configuration in your vimrc, after/ftplugin/rmd.vim or somewhere else. Could you please try with a minimal vimrc like this:<div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">set</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> nocompatible<br>call plug</span><span style=\"color:#800\">#begin(&#39;~/.config/nvim/plugged&#39;)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Plug</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;jalvesaq/Nvim-R&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>call plug</span><span style=\"color:#800\">#end()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>filetype plugin indent on<br>syntax on<br>let R_tmux_split </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>Of course, you have to replace lines 2, 3 and 4 if you do not use vim-plug. I will release a new version of Nvim-R soon, but I think no change since 0.9.3 is relevant for this issue.</div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "1OM-uDxmKwAJ",
   "from": "Fong Chun Chan",
   "author": "61221ab1f726dce8",
   "date": "2016-05-16T17:57:52Z",
   "subject": "Re: Nvim-R: Syntax Highlighting Not Working in Rmarkdown Chunks",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Performed the following steps:<div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div>1. <span style=\"line-height:17px\">Removed the ~/.vim folder</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\">2. Installed the vim-plugin</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\">3. Replaced my ~/.vimrc with the following (modified to use just vim as I don&#39;t use neovim):</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">set</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> nocompatible<br>call plug</span><span style=\"color:#800\">#begin(&#39;~/.config/plugged&#39;)</span></div></code></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Plug</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;jalvesaq/Nvim-R&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>call plug</span><span style=\"color:#800\">#end()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>filetype plugin indent on<br>syntax on<br>let R_tmux_split </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span></div></code></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div></div></code></div></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\">4. Same issue:</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-fYzAqgONgoM/VzoI50kN0gI/AAAAAAAAvWs/hDe1eozt47kuEmddQjeVwo51kECCV6wggCLcB/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2016-05-16%2Bat%2B10.50.15%2BAM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-fYzAqgONgoM/VzoI50kN0gI/AAAAAAAAvWs/hDe1eozt47kuEmddQjeVwo51kECCV6wggCLcB/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2016-05-16%252Bat%252B10.50.15%252BAM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494115880000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZwfTSdqHic0IazERPbkP2\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-fYzAqgONgoM/VzoI50kN0gI/AAAAAAAAvWs/hDe1eozt47kuEmddQjeVwo51kECCV6wggCLcB/s320/Screen%2BShot%2B2016-05-16%2Bat%2B10.50.15%2BAM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"311\"></a></p><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\">Again no problem with a normal R script:</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-9QG5aggOFcg/VzoJbFzpJkI/AAAAAAAAvWw/P4ACZF4JzN0WNYwSgd-WhfpMYvRHfEzzwCLcB/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2016-05-16%2Bat%2B10.53.42%2BAM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-9QG5aggOFcg/VzoJbFzpJkI/AAAAAAAAvWw/P4ACZF4JzN0WNYwSgd-WhfpMYvRHfEzzwCLcB/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2016-05-16%252Bat%252B10.53.42%252BAM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494115881000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Ka7p0qJmTfhBlDPfTB02K\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-9QG5aggOFcg/VzoJbFzpJkI/AAAAAAAAvWw/P4ACZF4JzN0WNYwSgd-WhfpMYvRHfEzzwCLcB/s320/Screen%2BShot%2B2016-05-16%2Bat%2B10.53.42%2BAM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"298\" height=\"320\"></a></p><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\">Some additional technical details if it matters. </span><span style=\"line-height:17px\">Using vim 7.4.1722 compiled from source:</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">./</span><span style=\"color:#000\">configure </span><span style=\"color:#660\">--</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prefix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">/home/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fong</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">usr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#008\">local</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>make<br>make install</span></div></code></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\">On a Centos:</span><br></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fong@rogue </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~]</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$ cat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">etc</span><span style=\"color:#800\">/*-release<br>CentOS Linux release 7.2.1511 (Core)<br>NAME=&quot;CentOS Linux&quot;<br>VERSION=&quot;7 (Core)&quot;<br>ID=&quot;centos&quot;<br>ID_LIKE=&quot;rhel fedora&quot;<br>VERSION_ID=&quot;7&quot;<br>PRETTY_NAME=&quot;CentOS Linux 7 (Core)&quot;<br>ANSI_COLOR=&quot;0;31&quot;<br>CPE_NAME=&quot;cpe:/o:centos:centos:7&quot;<br>HOME_URL=&quot;<a href=\"https://www.centos.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.centos.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494115881000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0RJ3lQCgGCXTcvkPVfWv0H\">https://www.centos.org/</a>&quot;<br>BUG_REPORT_URL=&quot;<a href=\"https://bugs.centos.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bugs.centos.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494115881000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0_tp911Hw_2ewf7wpZzX7f\">https://bugs.centos.org/</a>&quot;<br><br><br>CENTOS_MANTISBT_PROJECT=&quot;CentOS-7&quot;<br>CENTOS_MANTISBT_PROJECT_VERSION=&quot;7&quot;<br>REDHAT_SUPPORT_PRODUCT=&quot;centos&quot;<br>REDHAT_SUPPORT_PRODUCT_VERSION=&quot;7&quot;<br><br><br>CentOS Linux release 7.2.1511 (Core)<br>CentOS Linux release 7.2.1511 (Core)</span></div></code></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
